[
  {
    "title": "Nested Decisions & Boundary Tests",
    "tag": "LESSON 12",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I · Nested selection",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Nested Decisions<br>&amp; Boundary Tests</h1><p class=\"zh\">嵌套选择 · 边界测试 · 分段规则</p><p class=\"small\">90 minutes · One path can contain another decision.</p>",
    "note": "承接L11单层IF/ELSE，本课把三个互斥收费区间实现为嵌套选择。重点不在背年龄收费常识，所有价格与年龄段都由本教学例规定。最终学生修改边界并提交测试证据，不进入循环。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve one decision first",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.H · AAP-2.E",
    "html": "<p>An IF / ELSE tests <span class=\"mono\">age < 12</span>.</p><ol><li>What is the condition value at age 12?</li><li>Does ELSE run after a true IF block finishes?</li><li>If age < 12 is false, what do we know about age?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">false; no; age is at least 12.</div></details>",
    "note": "最后一问是嵌套推理的支点：进入ELSE后已经知道先前条件为假。允许学生先用数轴说明，再写age>=12。若把ELSE理解为另一次测试，先回L11的条件快照而不是强行开始多层嵌套。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Learning goals",
    "tag": "GOALS",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I · Nested selection",
    "html": "<ol><li>Read one IF inside another branch.</li><li>Trace three mutually exclusive outcomes.</li><li>Test both sides of each boundary.</li><li>Modify a piecewise pricing rule and verify the change.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Use braces to identify which ELSE belongs to which IF.</p>",
    "note": "明确本课使用嵌套IF，参考表没有单独要求ELSE IF语法，所以不引入该写法。代码展示保持每个大括号独立行、缩进一致。不能仅凭最接近的文字猜ELSE归属，要看完整块结构。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Why one decision may not be enough",
    "tag": "THREE OUTCOMES",
    "time": "8–12 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I.1 · AAP-2.G",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Toy ticket prices · valid whole-number age 0–120; 0–11: fee 5, 12–64: fee 12, 65–120: fee 7\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Toy ticket prices · valid whole-number age 0–120</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">0–11</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">fee 5</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12–64</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">fee 12</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">65–120</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">fee 7</text></svg></figure><p>A first decision can select one group. Another decision separates the remaining groups.</p><p class=\"small\">The three ranges are disjoint and cover all valid inputs.</p>",
    "note": "先从规则分组而不是代码开始。每个合法年龄只属于一个区间，不能重叠也不能漏掉12或65。收费只是原创练习设定，不代表实际机构政策。输入有效性由题目保证，程序尚未检查非整数或超范围。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A second decision inside the false path",
    "tag": "NESTED FLOW",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I.1",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"First test age under12. If true use fee5. Otherwise test age under65: true gives fee12, false gives fee7.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 268\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><path d=\"M290 7L495 73L290 139L85 73Z\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">age &lt; 12 ?</text><path d=\"M820 7L1025 73L820 139L615 73Z\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"820\" y=\"83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">age &lt; 65 ?</text><path d=\"M500 73H590\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M590 67L602 73L590 79Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><text x=\"551\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">false</text><path d=\"M290 140V167\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M284 167L290 179L296 167Z\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"237\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">true</text><path d=\"M820 140L690 178M820 140L1040 178\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"700\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">true</text><text x=\"993\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#225a83\">false</text><rect x=\"145\" y=\"184\" width=\"255\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"272\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">fee 5</text><rect x=\"565\" y=\"184\" width=\"255\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"692\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">fee 12</text><rect x=\"920\" y=\"184\" width=\"255\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1047\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">fee 7</text></svg></figure><p class=\"callout\">The second condition is reached only when <span class=\"mono\">age < 12</span> is false.</p>",
    "note": "沿三条路径分别口述：小于12直接得到5；否则已经至少12，再判断是否小于65；若还是假就是65及以上。虽然图有两个判断菱形，一次运行不一定都访问到，儿童分支只做第一个条件。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Trace the path before reading code",
    "tag": "PREDICT · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I · Nested selection",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two decisions form three exclusive paths. The second test is reached only when the first test is false. The fee values are left for prediction.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 268\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><path d=\"M290 7L495 73L290 139L85 73Z\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">age &lt; 12 ?</text><path d=\"M820 7L1025 73L820 139L615 73Z\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"820\" y=\"83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">age &lt; 65 ?</text><path d=\"M500 73H590\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M590 67L602 73L590 79Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><text x=\"551\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">false</text><path d=\"M290 140V167\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M284 167L290 179L296 167Z\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"237\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">true</text><path d=\"M820 140L690 178M820 140L1040 178\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"700\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">true</text><text x=\"993\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#225a83\">false</text><rect x=\"145\" y=\"184\" width=\"255\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"272\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">chosen fee?</text><rect x=\"565\" y=\"184\" width=\"255\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"692\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">chosen fee?</text><rect x=\"920\" y=\"184\" width=\"255\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1047\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">chosen fee?</text></svg></figure><p>Predict the selected fee for ages <strong>11, 12 and 65</strong>.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">11 → 5; 12 → 12; 65 → 7. At age 11 the second test is not reached.</div></details>",
    "note": "让三位学生分别标一条路径，其他学生检查是否错误地多走一支。图中不显示价格答案，但学生可引用上一页规则；目的是路径推理而不是记忆猜测。揭晓时区分条件为假与条件没有被执行，这两种情况不同。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Three prices, one complete program",
    "tag": "WORKED CODE",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I.a",
    "html": "<pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.08;padding:16px;margin:12px 0\">age ← INPUT()\nIF(age &lt; 12)\n{\n  fee ← 5\n}\nELSE\n{\n  IF(age &lt; 65)\n  {\n    fee ← 12\n  }\n  ELSE\n  {\n    fee ← 7\n  }\n}\nDISPLAY(fee)</pre>",
    "note": "这页只展示完整代码，教师按外层选择和其ELSE中的内层选择分两段朗读。每个IF都有相应ELSE和大括号；最后DISPLAY在外层选择之后，三条路径都会执行一次。不要把该页展开成对每个数字测试，下一页专门解释块的归属。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Braces show which ELSE belongs where",
    "tag": "BLOCK STRUCTURE",
    "time": "24–28 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I.1",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An outer IF has a true block assigning5 and an ELSE containing the entire inner IF/ELSE. The inner true and false blocks assign12 and7.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 253\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"10\" width=\"1170\" height=\"230\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">OUTER IF / ELSE</text><rect x=\"42\" y=\"82\" width=\"340\" height=\"115\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"212\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">outer true block</text><text x=\"212\" y=\"169\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">fee ← 5</text><rect x=\"447\" y=\"69\" width=\"702\" height=\"153\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"798\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#225a83\">outer ELSE contains a complete inner IF / ELSE</text><rect x=\"475\" y=\"125\" width=\"300\" height=\"67\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"625\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">inner true: fee 12</text><rect x=\"798\" y=\"125\" width=\"322\" height=\"67\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">inner false: fee 7</text></svg></figure><p>The inner ELSE chooses between 12 and 7. The outer ELSE contains that whole choice.</p><p class=\"small\">Indentation is a reading aid; the braces define the blocks.</p>",
    "note": "用两种颜色沿大括号画框，先找到外层ELSE的范围，再找其中的IF和ELSE。误配ELSE时可能得到能执行但逻辑错误的程序，所以不只检查是否有语法错误。图是块包含关系，不是额外运行步骤。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Use what the earlier path already tells you",
    "tag": "PATH KNOWLEDGE",
    "time": "28–32 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I.b · AAP-2.F",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Outer test false: age &gt;= 12 → Inner test true: age &lt; 65 → Both facts: 12 &lt;= age &lt; 65\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Outer test false</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">age &gt;= 12</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Inner test true</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">age &lt; 65</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Both facts</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">12 &lt;= age &lt; 65</text></svg></figure><p>The inner condition does not need to repeat <span class=\"mono\">age >= 12</span>.</p><p class=\"small\">The final range notation is a mathematical explanation, not chained comparison syntax for the lab.</p>",
    "note": "说明内层单写age<65为什么不是把0到11又收一次成人费。到达内层本来就排除了儿童，已知事实来自控制流。数学区间12<=age<65仅用于解释，程序需要布尔AND时应分别写两个比较，不把连写关系当AP语法。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Boundary pairs catch gaps and overlaps",
    "tag": "TEST BOTH CUTS",
    "time": "32–36 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.J.1–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two boundaries need two below/at pairs; 11: child edge, 12: adult start, 64: adult edge, 65: senior start\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Two boundaries need two below/at pairs</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">11</text><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">child edge</text><rect x=\"325.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">adult start</text><rect x=\"600.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">64</text><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">adult edge</text><rect x=\"875.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">65</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">senior start</text></svg></figure><p>Write expected fees before running the program.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">11 → 5; 12 → 12; 64 → 12; 65 → 7.</div></details>",
    "note": "四个值是两个边界的紧邻测试，优先于随机选四个年龄。若只测试11和65，可能漏掉成人区间的端点错误。让学生把<12与<65分别对应一对测试，说明错误运算符会影响哪一个输入。"
  },
  {
    "title": "An inclusive boundary changes a category",
    "tag": "ORIGINAL DEBUGGING",
    "time": "36–40 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I.b · CRD-2.J",
    "html": "<p>A student replaces the outer condition <span class=\"mono\">age < 12</span> with <span class=\"mono\">age <= 12</span>.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Which test distinguishes the two versions?; 11: same path, 12: boundary case, 13: same path\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Which test distinguishes the two versions?</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">11</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">same path</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">boundary case</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">13</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">same path</text></svg></figure><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>12</strong>. The incorrect version charges 5; the requirement charges 12.</div></details>",
    "note": "先预测哪条输入输出发生变化，再运行验证。11和13在两个版本下相同，所以只看这两次会误判程序正确。不要把边界全部改成<=；每个条件应根据区间定义决定是否含端点。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Broad conditions can hide later cases",
    "tag": "ORDER MATTERS",
    "time": "40–44 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I · AAP-2.L.2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Test first: age &gt;= 12 → True branch: charge adult fee → Later senior test: may never be reached\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Test first</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">age &gt;= 12</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">True branch</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">charge adult fee</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Later senior test</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">may never be reached</text></svg></figure><p>If the senior test is inside the first test’s ELSE, age 70 never reaches it.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Age 70 already satisfies age >= 12. Test the narrower senior case first, or keep the original under-12 / under-65 structure.</div></details>",
    "note": "这是“先匹配宽区间会吞掉窄区间”的具体反例，不等于任何条件换序都会错误。说明例子的结构是后续测试在ELSE中，不能把它当成两个独立IF。反例70足够说明现有次序不满足老人7元规则。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Predict how many tests are reached",
    "tag": "ORIGINAL PRACTICE",
    "time": "44–48 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I.b",
    "html": "<p>Use the original under-12 / under-65 program.</p><table style=\"font-size:25px\"><thead><tr><th>Age</th><th>Outer test reached?</th><th>Inner test reached?</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>8</td><td>?</td><td>?</td></tr><tr><td>40</td><td>?</td><td>?</td></tr><tr><td>80</td><td>?</td><td>?</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">8: outer yes, inner no. 40 and 80: both tests are reached. A test that is not reached has no evaluated result in that run.</div></details>",
    "note": "让学生区分“检查了且假”与“根本没有到达”。8的内层条件不是假，而是没有求值。本题不要求估算运行时间，检查次数仅帮助理解控制路径。使用更多条件并不意味着每次都执行所有判断。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Describe the algorithm without code",
    "tag": "DESIGN",
    "time": "48–52 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.G · AAP-2.I",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"First split: under 12? → Remaining ages: under 65? → Merge: display selected fee\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">First split</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">under 12?</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Remaining ages</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">under 65?</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Merge</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">display selected fee</text></svg></figure><p>Write a three-case explanation that assigns one fee to every valid age.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">If under 12, use 5. Otherwise, if under 65, use 12; otherwise use 7. Then display the fee.</div></details>",
    "note": "先用自然语言写覆盖所有输入的规则，再对照完整代码。要求说清第二判断只发生在第一判断为假时；只列三个条件而没交代组合结构不够明确。这里展示英语表达，不要求用ELSE IF代码语法。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Plan the implementation and evidence",
    "tag": "PREPARE THE LAB",
    "time": "52–55 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.J",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"No loops; one input per run; Input: integer age, Rule: three ranges, Output: one numeric fee\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">No loops; one input per run</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Input</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">integer age</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Rule</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">three ranges</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Output</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">one numeric fee</text></svg></figure><p>Prepare the four boundary tests and one ordinary age from each range.</p><p class=\"small\">Use ages 5, 30 and 80 for the ordinary cases.</p>",
    "note": "这页在进入设备前整理测试计划。界限11/12/64/65与普通值5/30/80各自有用途；可以分配同桌两人各跑部分，但每人要能解释完整规则。不要让输入120的上界验证转成复杂合法性代码，当前范围是假设。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: start from the requirements",
    "tag": "PROGRAMMING · 55–60",
    "time": "55–60 min",
    "code": "Practical coding · AAP-2.I.a",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\"><a href=\"Chapter_3_Programming_Lab.html#nested\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the nested-decision lab ↗</a></p><ol><li>Write the three price ranges in your own words.</li><li>Choose meaningful variables age and fee.</li><li>Enter one numeric age per run; braces go on separate lines.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Do not use ELSE IF syntax; place a complete IF inside the outer ELSE.</p>",
    "note": "先清空或核对实验室预设，避免学生只看现成输出而未编写。每次队列只需要一个数字，例如12，数字不加引号。教师检查起草结构而非直接填好所有行；必须留时间让学生自己运行和修正。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: build three exclusive price paths",
    "tag": "PROGRAMMING · 60–66",
    "time": "60–66 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I.a",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two decisions form three exclusive paths. The second test is reached only when the first test is false. The fee values are left for prediction.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 268\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><path d=\"M290 7L495 73L290 139L85 73Z\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">age &lt; 12 ?</text><path d=\"M820 7L1025 73L820 139L615 73Z\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"820\" y=\"83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">age &lt; 65 ?</text><path d=\"M500 73H590\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M590 67L602 73L590 79Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><text x=\"551\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">false</text><path d=\"M290 140V167\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M284 167L290 179L296 167Z\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"237\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">true</text><path d=\"M820 140L690 178M820 140L1040 178\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"700\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">true</text><text x=\"993\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#225a83\">false</text><rect x=\"145\" y=\"184\" width=\"255\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"272\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">chosen fee?</text><rect x=\"565\" y=\"184\" width=\"255\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"692\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">chosen fee?</text><rect x=\"920\" y=\"184\" width=\"255\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1047\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">chosen fee?</text></svg></figure><p>Build the nested program and place one DISPLAY after the outer block.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Outer true assigns 5. Inside outer ELSE, test age < 65: true assigns 12, false assigns 7. All three paths then display fee.</div></details>",
    "note": "六分钟编写与首次运行。参考完整例子可以帮助起步，但要求学生解释自己缩进和大括号的每层归属。模型提示故意不提供整段可复制代码，使学生完成实际组合；教师指南保留完整程序用于检查。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: run the boundary evidence",
    "tag": "PROGRAMMING · 66–71",
    "time": "66–71 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.J · AAP-2.I.b",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Expected → actual → pass/fail; 11: predict first, 12: predict first, 64: predict first, 65: predict first\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Expected → actual → pass/fail</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">11</text><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">predict first</text><rect x=\"325.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">predict first</text><rect x=\"600.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">64</text><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">predict first</text><rect x=\"875.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">65</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">predict first</text></svg></figure><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Expected fees: <strong>5, 12, 12, 7</strong>. Also check ordinary ages 5 → 5, 30 → 12, 80 → 7.</div></details>",
    "note": "先核对边界四次，再抽取普通年龄，输入队列每次重置。若输出未定义或为空，检查某条路径是否没有给fee赋值；若输出两个价格，检查DISPLAY是否重复或用了多个独立IF。记录首个错误路径再修改。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: move the child boundary to 13",
    "tag": "PROGRAMMING · 71–76",
    "time": "71–76 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.M.1 · CRD-2.J",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"New rule: children are under 13; other prices unchanged; 12: new child edge, 13: new adult start, 65: senior unchanged\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">New rule: children are under 13; other prices unchanged</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">new child edge</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">13</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">new adult start</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">65</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">senior unchanged</text></svg></figure><p>Modify the outer condition and create evidence for the changed behavior.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Use age < 13. Expected fees: 12 → 5; 13 → 12; 65 → 7.</div></details>",
    "note": "这不是简单更换示例输入，而是规则真正改变。强调年龄12的费用从12变5，13仍为12，老人界限65保持不变。学生应指出旧测试哪个需要更新预期，不能因为旧测试失败就随意改回旧代码。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: explain the changed path",
    "tag": "PROGRAMMING · 76–80",
    "time": "76–80 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.B / J",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Compare: old and new age12 → Justify: boundary changed → Submit: code + test log\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Compare</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">old and new age12</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Justify</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">boundary changed</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Submit</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">code + test log</text></svg></figure><p>Explain why the inner test is skipped for age 12 under the new rule.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">The outer condition age < 13 is now true, so fee becomes 5 and the outer ELSE is skipped.</div></details>",
    "note": "四分钟互评与交付。要求一个学生用代码解释，另一个沿流程图解释，两者应一致。保留修改前后版本和一次关键反例，形成今后项目的开发证据习惯；不把课堂记录冒称正式Create材料。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Which two claims are correct?",
    "tag": "AP-STYLE · SELECT TWO",
    "time": "80–83 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I",
    "html": "<ol><li>A. Every nested IF is evaluated in every run.</li><li>B. An inner IF is reached only if its containing block executes.</li><li>C. Braces identify the block to which an ELSE belongs.</li><li>D. Testing only a typical middle value proves every boundary correct.</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>B and C.</strong> Unchosen blocks are skipped. Boundary tests require boundary-specific evidence.</div></details>",
    "note": "先选两项再用8岁与65岁作反例说明A和D的问题。避免把“括号识别ELSE”说成只看缩进，因为缩进可能写错而大括号决定结构。所有例子均原创。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Homework and the next lesson",
    "tag": "CONSOLIDATE",
    "time": "83–85 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I · Nested selection",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">12 original questions · 30 classroom marks · about 40 minutes.</p><ol><li>Trace the outer path before the inner condition.</li><li>State the valid ranges and test each boundary.</li><li>Write nested IF / ELSE with explicit braces.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Next: repeat a block a known number of times.</p>",
    "note": "提醒书面题完整代码较长，先搭括号骨架再填写条件和赋值。图解、代码和自然语言三种表示应表达同一规则。下一课使用计数循环，但本课作业无需循环。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit ticket: nested paths",
    "tag": "EXIT · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "85–90 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.I · Nested selection",
    "html": "<ol><li>Original rule: which fee applies at age 12?</li><li>At age 8, is the inner test reached?</li><li>Which boundary input exposes age <= 12 as a mistake?</li><li>Does a later nested senior test help if age >= 12 already chose an adult branch?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. 12. 2. No. 3. 12. 4. No: that branch has already excluded the nested alternative.</div></details>",
    "note": "三分钟独立完成。建议四项中至少三项正确，且第2项路径可达性正确后继续。若学生只记价格不懂路径，以新年龄重画决策树；边界错误则用11/12/13连续三个整数核验。"
  }
]
